0%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">12</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.9932%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0068%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.9932%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Personal Assistant (PA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0068%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must have a graduate with Hindi Stenography speed of 100 w.p.m. and Hindi/English typing speed of 30 w.p.m. A computer certificate from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT or \u2018O\u2019 Level is desirable. The pay scale is Level-07 (\u20b944,900\u20131,42,400).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.9932%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Data Entry Operator DEO</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0068%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must have Intermediate (10+2) qualification with a typing speed of 8000 key-depressions per hour. A computer certificate like ADCA or one from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT (\u2018O\u2019 Level) is desirable. The pay scale is Level-04 (\u20b925,500\u201381,100).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.9932%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Lower Division Clerk (LDC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0068%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must have Intermediate (10+2) qualification with Hindi/English typing speed of 30 w.p.m. A computer certificate from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT or \u2018O\u2019 Level is desirable. The pay scale is Level-02 (\u20b919,900\u201363,200).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.9932%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0068%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must have Graduate with Hindi Stenography speed of 80 w.p.m. and Hindi/English typing speed of 30 w.p.m. A computer certificate from AICTE/DOEACC/NIELIT or \u2018O\u2019 Level is desirable. The pay scale is Level-04 (\u20b925,500\u201381,100).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : </span></strong><strong><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/dsssb-non-teaching-various-post-recruitment-2025/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DSSSB Non-Teaching Various Post Online Form 2025</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; download Bihar Vidhan Parishad LDC / PA Pre Result 2026\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"250\" data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"170\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong>official website</strong> of</span><br data-end=\"205\" data-start=\"202\"/><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline curso